1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
Wet carpet after it rains?

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,000
It might not be a leak at all.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Water pooling under the mats,

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
a musty smell, no visible drip anywhere.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,800
One clue: leaves and debris clog

6
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:15,000
the drain under your wipers — water backs up into the cabin.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Left alone, that trapped water

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
can rust the floor pan and short out wiring.

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Don't guess where it's coming from.

10
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,000
A quick check under the cowl can spot it fast.

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Worth checking before it gets worse.

12
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Stop by and we'll take a look — Nick's Tire & Auto.
